# The sample access variation point attaches to the HTTP example: it adds its
# middleware packages (internal/command/middleware/{access,batchlimit},
# internal/api/http/middleware/authentication) and changes
# only the composition root, the command it marks, and the readme and Makefile.
base library/architecture/go/vp-http-api-in-go.skill/examples
change cmd/todo/main.go
change internal/command/plan_items.go
change Makefile
change README.md
